# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TIER-2 (research lab-notebook) is TRACKED on `main` (private) but EXCLUDED from
# the PUBLIC snapshot by scripts/publish.sh (see PRIVATE_PATHS there). These are
# the current derivations / scoping — committed so they are backed up and visible,
# never pushed to the public GitHub. So they are deliberately NOT ignored here:
#     _scratch/ (any depth), docs/_scratch/, docs/scoping/, docs/open_problems/, papers/
# (If you want to KEEP something truly local-only, put it under a Tier-1 path below.)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Tier-1 (session / process ephemera) — kept LOCAL, never tracked, never published:
docs/audits/sessions/
docs/handoffs/

